bjects.<br><br>• Realistic visual effects-photorealistic visual effects.<br><br>• Excellent lighting-effective lighting enhances the horror atmosphere.<br><br>• Quality sounds-carefully chosen quality sound effects and soundtracks which enrich the atmosphere.<br><br>• A variety of enemies-battle enemies and explore the dark streets and buildings.<br><br>• Puzzles-solve puzzles to gain access to new areas and use objects which you find in your nightmarish struggle for survival.<br><br>• An intriguing mystery-there is nothing as good as an enticing story. A story which holds you in suspense from the first minute to the last.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1166740/extras/18df8c231ac4c406a84c2313f800a034.webp?t=1746093404\" width=600 height=25 /></span>", "short_description": "The story of Henry Nelson is a psychological first-person thriller, based on real events. It is a game in which the player will experience mysterious events and take part in an unbelievable journey.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1166740/header.jpg?t=1746093404", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1166740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746093404", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1166740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746093404", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows  7/8/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel CORE i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce 820m<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 11 GB available space<b